WEBVTT

00:00.550 --> 00:02.100
Here, thanks for waiting.

00:02.100 --> 00:03.350
Thanks!

00:03.830 --> 00:05.760
Happy birthday!

00:06.860 --> 00:08.770
Oh, thank you!

00:08.770 --> 00:10.410
This is from us!

00:08.770 --> 00:11.190
Hey, what are they doing?

00:11.400 --> 00:13.450
It's a birthday celebration.

00:13.450 --> 00:15.690
Huh, how festive.

00:16.300 --> 00:17.860
So, what's a birthday?

00:17.860 --> 00:18.490
Huh?

00:20.000 --> 00:24.840
The problem is that Blade doesn't 
know when his own birthday is.

00:24.840 --> 00:27.420
That means we can't celebrate it.

00:27.420 --> 00:31.020
Truth be told, we don't 
know his exact age, either.

00:31.020 --> 00:34.300
He could already stand and walk 
by the time they found him.

00:34.620 --> 00:38.390
We assumed he was one year old, 
which would make him 17 now.

00:38.390 --> 00:39.920
Oh, in that case,

00:39.920 --> 00:42.810
do you know the day that they found him?

00:43.810 --> 00:46.320
I believe the Great— Wait, no!

00:46.320 --> 00:49.550
Blade told me about it was once.

00:49.550 --> 00:51.360
It's coming up in about a month.

00:51.360 --> 00:55.200
I heard that when they found him, 
he was holding a sword.

00:55.200 --> 00:57.620
Ah, so that's why he's named Blade.

00:57.620 --> 01:01.060
Does that mean he'd be Lance 
if it had been a lance?

01:01.920 --> 01:04.000
Club if it was a club?

01:04.000 --> 01:06.190
Man, that's hilarious!

01:06.190 --> 01:09.380
Now all we need is something 
Blade would like.

01:09.380 --> 01:11.600
What would he want?

01:11.600 --> 01:13.180
How about tonkatsu curry?

01:13.180 --> 01:15.040
I'm pretty sure that won't do.

01:15.040 --> 01:16.760
I-I know that!

01:16.760 --> 01:19.500
I just can't think of anything else.

01:19.500 --> 01:20.970
I see!

01:22.980 --> 01:25.130
Tonkatsu curry as a present!

01:25.130 --> 01:27.100
Nothing wrong with some tasty food!

01:27.100 --> 01:30.020
Everyone loves it! I do, too!

01:31.330 --> 01:32.710
Um, Your Majesty...

01:32.710 --> 01:35.280
He can get tonkatsu curry in the cafeteria.

01:35.280 --> 01:37.260
What if it wasn't normal, then?

01:37.260 --> 01:37.950
Yes!

01:37.950 --> 01:42.330
You just need to prepare a special, 
royal tonkatsu curry for him!

01:42.330 --> 01:43.020
Huh?

01:47.790 --> 01:49.920
Now, behold!

01:51.210 --> 01:55.130
This is the Royal Pantry, 
the pride of our kingdom!

01:55.640 --> 01:57.470
Hey, what's going on?!

01:57.920 --> 02:01.550
You'll be getting some 
hands-on training in here.

02:01.900 --> 02:05.070
Go on and eat your fill of delicious foods!

02:05.070 --> 02:06.980
What?!

02:13.190 --> 02:17.200
<i>I look in your eyes, and I'm met with</i>

02:17.200 --> 02:21.750
<i>A brand-new me and dream</i>

02:31.790 --> 02:34.500
<i>Bravery? Naturally?</i>

02:34.500 --> 02:37.090
<i>Polar opposites within the heart</i>

02:37.090 --> 02:39.760
<i>But, you know, wanting to have both</i>

02:39.760 --> 02:42.390
<i>That's the saga of human nature</i>

02:42.390 --> 02:44.950
<i>Oh no, don't mind me</i>

02:44.950 --> 02:47.890
<i>Go ahead, and so on, you know the rest</i>

02:47.890 --> 02:50.150
<i>A little more? Wait, even harder?!</i>

02:50.150 --> 02:53.060
<i>Going overboard much?</i>

02:53.060 --> 02:55.070
<i>Those selfish emotions deep down</i>

02:55.070 --> 02:57.650
<i>Bringing them to light is what friendship's about</i>

02:57.650 --> 03:00.660
<i>Spending adolescence duking it out with pals</i>

03:00.660 --> 03:03.910
<i>I don't wanna lose</i>

03:04.330 --> 03:07.210
<i>We're off to the cutting edge moment</i>

03:07.210 --> 03:11.040
<i>Fight with best friends, and leave no regrets</i>

03:11.040 --> 03:16.000
<i>You should laugh, since you look best with a smile</i>

03:16.000 --> 03:21.630
<i>On the ropes?! No matter what we face, et cetera</i>

03:21.630 --> 03:24.640
<i>Just sit back and enjoy it</i>

03:24.640 --> 03:31.830
<i>Whatever may come, I'll be here to protect you</i>

03:38.940 --> 03:41.990
<b>Episode 10</b>

03:39.840 --> 03:41.990
<b>I'm Looking for
Something
Tastier than Me</b>

03:41.990 --> 03:44.620
What are you gonna make us do this time?

03:44.920 --> 03:48.440
Um, we're underneath the castle, aren't we?

03:48.440 --> 03:52.370
Could this be some sort of ancient, 
grand magic that collapses space on itself?

03:56.770 --> 04:01.910
Those doors will not open until the 
required condition has been met!

04:01.910 --> 04:03.590
The condition to open the doors...

04:03.870 --> 04:07.600
is to consume a combined total 
of 11.3 billion calories.

04:08.640 --> 04:10.720
100 million calories per person?!

04:10.720 --> 04:13.650
So we have to survive out here until then?

04:13.650 --> 04:14.440
Sniff, sniff...

04:14.440 --> 04:16.730
I smell lots of tasty things!

04:16.730 --> 04:18.130
Exactly!

04:18.130 --> 04:22.530
There are ingredients preserved here 
that date back to the age of the gods.

04:22.530 --> 04:27.210
We say preserved, but all the plants and 
animals here are uncontrollably violent,

04:27.210 --> 04:30.040
so in reality, they've been 
allowed to run rampant.

04:30.040 --> 04:32.570
Thin out their numbers a bit, won't you?

04:34.920 --> 04:40.320
Hey, that's a job for a group 
of hero-level warriors!

04:40.320 --> 04:42.980
Are you really gonna make us students do it?

04:42.980 --> 04:44.180
Right, Earnest?

04:44.180 --> 04:44.930
Okay!

04:44.930 --> 04:46.500
Here we go, everyone!

04:47.490 --> 04:49.410
First, we need to establish a campsite!

04:49.410 --> 04:50.470
Yep.

04:51.890 --> 04:53.080
Parent!

04:53.080 --> 04:54.520
I can hardly wait!

04:55.360 --> 04:56.310
Huh?

05:00.820 --> 05:02.780
Hey! Over here!

05:04.900 --> 05:07.570
This way! Right here!

05:07.570 --> 05:08.910
Magnificent!

05:08.910 --> 05:10.280
Now, get it in the pit trap...

05:10.280 --> 05:11.410
Leonard!

05:17.400 --> 05:19.380
Hey, why me?!

05:20.410 --> 05:23.880
Ah, I guess it thinks Claire looks tastier.

05:24.160 --> 05:25.260
Watch out! Mademois—

05:26.720 --> 05:27.940
Leonard!

05:29.950 --> 05:32.370
Fighting weaklings is no fun, but...

05:32.370 --> 05:33.390
What happened?!

05:33.660 --> 05:35.640
Hey! Are you alright?!

05:36.520 --> 05:37.760
Well, if I must.

05:37.760 --> 05:39.400
Satan Levin.

05:42.070 --> 05:44.440
Yes! Now we have food!

05:44.440 --> 05:46.490
Oh, it's already over?

05:48.190 --> 05:49.890
Open the gates!

05:51.740 --> 05:52.800
There!

05:52.800 --> 05:54.570
Okay, all good?

06:04.320 --> 06:06.460
If we build more lookout towers here,

06:06.460 --> 06:09.430
we'll be equipped to 
confront outside invaders!

06:19.260 --> 06:20.980
What about the repairs to the southern wall?

06:20.980 --> 06:23.310
Yeah, we just finished.

06:23.310 --> 06:24.080
I understand.

06:24.080 --> 06:25.010
Everyone!

06:25.010 --> 06:27.990
It's almost time for dinner, 
so work hard until then!

06:34.160 --> 06:38.120
Maybe the king came up with 
a good exercise this time.

06:42.320 --> 06:44.750
Don't stare too much.

06:45.210 --> 06:47.260
Okay, I won't look.

06:53.400 --> 06:55.390
You're really not looking?

06:55.390 --> 06:56.930
You're the one who told me not to.

07:01.130 --> 07:01.900
Hey.

07:01.900 --> 07:05.230
What were you like as a child?

07:05.230 --> 07:06.320
Well, you know...

07:06.320 --> 07:08.990
Like, do you remember any celebrations?

07:08.990 --> 07:10.050
Huh?

07:10.050 --> 07:12.820
I basically spent 24 hours a day fighting.

07:12.820 --> 07:13.810
Eh?

07:13.810 --> 07:16.880
Were you training to become 
stronger or something?

07:16.880 --> 07:19.300
Nope, just fighting for my life.

07:19.300 --> 07:22.020
You'll die if you're weaker 
than whoever attacks you.

07:22.020 --> 07:24.590
So getting stronger was just a fact of life.

07:24.590 --> 07:26.610
Become stronger or die.

07:26.610 --> 07:29.320
I was faced with that decision every day.

07:29.320 --> 07:30.470
What are you saying?

07:30.470 --> 07:31.840
What?

07:31.840 --> 07:33.470
You asked what I was like as a kid.

07:38.960 --> 07:41.990
Hey, Blade, I...

07:47.120 --> 07:48.110
Wait, Claire!

07:48.110 --> 07:50.490
Don't go any further than that!

07:50.490 --> 07:52.060
Huh? You two...

07:52.060 --> 07:53.490
Y-Y-You...

07:53.490 --> 07:55.990
You were watching?!

08:02.750 --> 08:06.360
We sure did get used to living here.

08:06.360 --> 08:08.710
I wonder how many calories we've consumed.

08:08.710 --> 08:14.010
Including today's share, we have 
reached 47% of our calorie target.

08:14.010 --> 08:17.140
According to my high-spec 
powers of calculation,

08:17.140 --> 08:20.940
we will most certainly meet our 
target by the designated date.

08:23.530 --> 08:25.170
Very impressive!

08:25.170 --> 08:27.270
It seems your survival 
exercise is going well.

08:27.270 --> 08:28.890
Survival?

08:28.890 --> 08:30.780
Has the king forgotten the original goal?

08:30.780 --> 08:31.420
Ah...

08:33.150 --> 08:36.480
As you've worked to survive, 
you've all grown so much,

08:36.480 --> 08:39.540
and it seems the original task 
might be a little too easy for you.

08:39.540 --> 08:40.790
And so!

08:42.510 --> 08:44.880
I've prepared a special challenge!

08:44.880 --> 08:48.860
I want you all to gather the 
ingredients listed here!

08:58.640 --> 09:01.470
How are these different from the 
ingredients we've faced so far?

09:01.470 --> 09:03.730
Will you accept the challenge?

09:09.490 --> 09:11.610
Okay, let's go get that reward!

09:15.740 --> 09:16.910
That's...

09:19.620 --> 09:20.720
Cabbage!

09:20.720 --> 09:21.590
Yep, cabbage.

09:21.590 --> 09:22.740
Cabbage.

09:22.740 --> 09:25.160
I don't like veggies!

09:31.060 --> 09:33.090
That's an Emperor Cabbage!

09:33.090 --> 09:34.090
Emperor?

09:34.090 --> 09:37.490
The cabbage cultivar originally 
stored in the Royal Pantry

09:37.490 --> 09:39.720
went feral in these hostile conditions,

09:39.720 --> 09:41.860
and underwent adaptive evolution!

09:44.560 --> 09:46.210
I'll burn it to a crisp!

09:46.210 --> 09:47.040
You can't.

09:47.930 --> 09:49.940
We need it to be raw.

09:49.940 --> 09:51.720
Ah, that's right.

09:51.720 --> 09:52.550
Everyone!

09:52.550 --> 09:54.650
Let's reinforce our defenses 
and charge in all at once!

09:54.650 --> 09:56.050
Why raw?

09:56.050 --> 09:57.250
Whoa!

09:57.250 --> 09:58.360
Understood, my lord.

09:58.360 --> 09:59.320
Sure, let's do it!

10:02.280 --> 10:05.290
Everyone's really fired up for some reason.

10:05.290 --> 10:07.900
We've captured the Emperor Cabbage!

10:15.370 --> 10:16.800
There's no mistaking it.

10:16.800 --> 10:18.790
That's Boxing Corn.

10:18.790 --> 10:20.550
I get the corn part...

10:20.890 --> 10:22.400
But what's boxing?

10:22.400 --> 10:24.680
An ancient contest where you 
fight with only your fists.

10:28.580 --> 10:30.480
Hey! You wanna go?

10:30.480 --> 10:31.700
No, Blade.

10:31.700 --> 10:32.110
Eh?

10:32.110 --> 10:36.010
If you don't follow the procedure for 
defeating it, it won't taste good.

10:36.010 --> 10:37.820
You can only use your fists.

10:37.820 --> 10:38.990
You're kidding me!

10:38.990 --> 10:39.990
Um...

10:39.990 --> 10:42.450
You can capture it if the 
match goes to a decision,

10:42.450 --> 10:44.700
and you let it burn out to pure white ash.

10:44.700 --> 10:46.210
What does decision refer to here?

10:46.210 --> 10:48.120
So I can't knock it out?!

10:49.470 --> 10:50.090
Wait!

10:50.090 --> 10:52.250
If it's a fist fight, shouldn't 
Sophie or Iona fight instead?

10:52.250 --> 10:54.270
No substitutions allowed.

10:54.270 --> 10:55.550
The bell has already rung.

10:55.550 --> 10:56.760
H-Hey! Still—

11:00.540 --> 11:03.260
In that case, here I come!

11:10.400 --> 11:13.130
We've managed to capture the Boxing Corn.

11:13.130 --> 11:14.900
Good work, Blade.

11:15.200 --> 11:16.660
Wait, you too?!

11:16.660 --> 11:18.000
Go!

11:20.090 --> 11:21.080
Go!

11:22.790 --> 11:24.910
What's going on here?

11:25.220 --> 11:29.080
The spice is so strong,
 it's leaching out into the air.

11:29.080 --> 11:31.580
What a sorry sight you all are.

11:31.580 --> 11:34.520
You will not be able to 
become top-class like that.

11:34.520 --> 11:35.710
No, just look at you.

11:35.710 --> 11:38.120
These are not tears.

11:39.040 --> 11:41.160
This is cleaning solution for my eyeballs!

11:44.430 --> 11:45.650
Go!

11:45.650 --> 11:46.560
Sniff, sniff...

11:46.560 --> 11:49.730
Those sunflowers are giving 
off a tasty smell, too!

11:58.720 --> 11:59.360
Um...

11:59.740 --> 12:01.670
Those are Sunflowers.

12:01.670 --> 12:02.430
They can—

12:09.360 --> 12:10.370
This isn't good!

12:10.840 --> 12:13.870
It looks like they have the ability to 
store sunlight and then discharge it!

12:13.870 --> 12:15.350
Interesting.

12:15.350 --> 12:19.880
I'll show these lowly Sunflowers 
what happens when they oppose me!

12:21.990 --> 12:24.260
We dragons won't lose, either!

12:24.260 --> 12:26.790
I'll just cheer you on, yep.

12:28.060 --> 12:29.210
It's a carrot.

12:29.210 --> 12:30.480
Yes, a carrot.

12:30.480 --> 12:33.310
Is it going to bite or spit fire at us?

12:33.310 --> 12:35.150
No signs of movement.

12:35.150 --> 12:37.400
Guess I'll try pulling it out.

12:38.340 --> 12:39.150
Hup!

12:39.150 --> 12:40.570
Ah! H-Hold it right there!

12:40.570 --> 12:41.280
Huh?

12:44.610 --> 12:46.660
What? A psychological attack?!

12:46.990 --> 12:49.930
There's some very tiny writing at the bottom.

12:49.930 --> 12:52.890
A Greater Mandora will 
shriek when it's uprooted.

12:52.890 --> 12:53.520
Hey!

12:53.520 --> 12:56.670
It says here that its 
scream is a lethal curse!

12:56.670 --> 12:58.670
Good thing we noticed before it was too late.

12:58.670 --> 13:00.790
What do we do about this?

13:01.170 --> 13:02.490
Iona?

13:02.490 --> 13:07.250
I am not human, so curses meant for 
living organisms have no effect.

13:08.550 --> 13:10.240
Hup.

13:21.600 --> 13:22.900
Is it over?

13:22.900 --> 13:24.480
It should be safe now.

13:29.370 --> 13:33.040
That reminds me... I don't really like carrots.

13:33.040 --> 13:34.410
Huh? Really?

13:34.850 --> 13:37.880
Well, I don't mind eating 
them when they're in a dish.

13:37.880 --> 13:39.800
I-I see...

13:45.100 --> 13:46.170
Yes!

13:46.170 --> 13:48.130
You're all doing splendidly!

13:48.130 --> 13:50.050
What remarkable progress!

13:50.360 --> 13:55.470
Thanks to you, the ecosystem of the 
Royal Pantry has undergone a drastic change!

13:55.470 --> 14:00.110
The population will be about one-tenth
 what it was for the next few years.

14:00.110 --> 14:00.870
Huh?

14:00.870 --> 14:02.530
Is that a good thing?

14:02.530 --> 14:04.110
Won't they go extinct?

14:04.110 --> 14:07.810
They wouldn't give us so much trouble 
if we could make them go extinct.

14:07.810 --> 14:10.120
They're just like the weeds in your garden.

14:12.280 --> 14:14.490
Don't sweat the small stuff!

14:14.720 --> 14:15.580
Yes!

14:15.580 --> 14:18.120
Tomorrow, you face the final ingredient!

14:18.120 --> 14:19.750
The moment of truth!

14:22.750 --> 14:25.070
Look at this big tree!

14:25.070 --> 14:27.170
We are at the base of the main trunk.

14:27.170 --> 14:31.420
The energy leaked from the engine is
 most highly concentrated in this area.

14:32.100 --> 14:35.680
In other words, it's the 
spot richest in nutrients.

14:35.680 --> 14:38.540
It makes sense that the creature 
known as the king of the pantry

14:38.540 --> 14:40.810
would choose to occupy this location.

14:43.730 --> 14:45.150
Here it comes, everyone!

14:49.010 --> 14:50.660
So this is the king!

14:51.660 --> 14:54.280
The list simply says it's the Beast King.

14:54.280 --> 14:57.110
Also that it's strong and tasty.

14:57.110 --> 14:58.790
That's way too vague!

15:01.040 --> 15:05.200
What's the point of youth 
without hazards and adversity?

15:05.200 --> 15:09.050
It's only after you've overcome those
 that triumph and glory await!

15:09.050 --> 15:10.530
Blade!

15:10.530 --> 15:12.300
You can do it!

15:15.340 --> 15:16.980
Okay! Everyone!

15:19.430 --> 15:20.060
Eh?

15:28.130 --> 15:29.440
What?!

15:29.760 --> 15:31.330
That's a Behemoth.

15:31.330 --> 15:32.440
Oh?

15:32.440 --> 15:36.990
I had planned for beef to be the main dish, 
but Behemoth meat is a fine choice, too.

15:37.390 --> 15:38.900
Go on, hunt it down!

15:38.900 --> 15:43.330
It defeated the old king, so there's 
no problem calling it the Beast King!

15:43.700 --> 15:47.460
Behemoth meat is far tastier 
than beef, you know!

15:52.470 --> 15:54.990
Hey, now, that's outrageous!

15:54.990 --> 15:58.000
Hmm, does a Behemoth really taste that good?

15:58.000 --> 15:58.850
Eh?

15:58.850 --> 16:00.290
What a relief.

16:00.290 --> 16:04.350
We were about to make something 
so disappointing the main dish!

16:04.350 --> 16:05.960
Don't you all agree?

16:06.550 --> 16:07.860
Huh? Why?!

16:09.540 --> 16:10.720
How reassuring!

16:10.720 --> 16:12.110
How very reassuring!

16:12.410 --> 16:14.920
O sword! Consume my flesh!

16:14.920 --> 16:16.620
Use it as thy power!

16:18.450 --> 16:20.890
Everyone! Here we go!

16:24.850 --> 16:26.300
Alright!

16:36.400 --> 16:38.180
Claire, over here as well!

16:38.180 --> 16:39.600
Yeah, leave them to me!

16:44.850 --> 16:45.520
Now!

16:56.960 --> 16:57.740
Did we get it?

17:01.380 --> 17:02.500
It had no effect?!

17:05.850 --> 17:06.460
Oh, no!

17:07.710 --> 17:09.710
God Technique! Absolute Defense!

17:16.400 --> 17:17.220
Blade!

17:17.850 --> 17:21.010
There's only one technique 
that can take it down.

17:21.010 --> 17:22.470
I see.

17:22.470 --> 17:23.970
But how?

17:23.970 --> 17:28.480
It's not a technique you can use 
with only 15% of your power available.

17:28.480 --> 17:31.440
Yeah, it requires at least 30%.

17:31.930 --> 17:35.310
Which is why I need your assistance, Mao.

17:35.310 --> 17:37.500
Please take some of my spiritual energy!

17:39.320 --> 17:40.660
Interesting.

17:40.660 --> 17:42.200
You wish to use me as a vessel?

17:43.390 --> 17:44.740
Incredible.

17:44.740 --> 17:47.580
However, this way is faster.

17:53.540 --> 17:55.070
I'm about to overflow.

17:55.070 --> 17:56.880
You've filled me to the brim.

17:56.880 --> 17:57.790
R-Right...

17:57.790 --> 17:59.560
How long are you gonna keep us waiting?!

17:59.560 --> 18:00.550
R-Right!

18:00.870 --> 18:02.740
Now, if I hone my fighting spirit...

18:02.740 --> 18:04.750
Everyone! It's almost time!

18:05.520 --> 18:06.540
You can count on us.

18:06.540 --> 18:07.690
10 seconds, Iona.

18:08.070 --> 18:08.810
Yes.

18:09.860 --> 18:12.040
Interconnect link complete.

18:12.040 --> 18:13.570
Transmitting power.

18:13.570 --> 18:15.940
Artificial Great Hero Power: 
Gravity Manipulation.

18:20.920 --> 18:22.470
Target confirmed.

18:22.470 --> 18:24.790
Firing Positronium Cannon.

18:34.480 --> 18:35.910
We can't fully immobilize it!

18:35.910 --> 18:37.270
We'll stop that thing!

18:43.140 --> 18:44.510
Here we go, Demon King.

18:44.510 --> 18:46.770
Very well, Great Hero.

18:51.710 --> 18:53.320
Stand back, everyone!

18:54.730 --> 18:57.410
If good be in my path, strike down all good.

18:57.410 --> 18:59.450
If evil be in my path, strike down all evil.

19:06.030 --> 19:07.200
Holy Demon Blade!

19:19.760 --> 19:23.030
This was the technique you defeated me with.

19:23.030 --> 19:26.470
I can't use it... 
by myself anymore, though...

19:27.510 --> 19:31.150
It's thanks to... you taking half...

19:31.150 --> 19:32.730
What, Great Hero?

19:32.980 --> 19:34.480
Are you going to die?

19:35.320 --> 19:36.970
No, I'm not.

19:36.970 --> 19:38.390
I'm just tired.

19:38.390 --> 19:39.070
Also...

19:39.280 --> 19:40.190
Also?

19:40.840 --> 19:43.570
I'm so hungry!

19:45.120 --> 19:46.580
Just you wait, then.

19:48.680 --> 19:50.580
For what...

19:59.600 --> 20:02.000
It's gone up by 3%.

20:02.000 --> 20:02.630
What?

20:02.960 --> 20:06.390
You can use up to 18% of your strength now.

20:06.680 --> 20:08.460
Why hasn't it gone down?

20:08.460 --> 20:11.400
Eating properly, getting moderate exercise...

20:11.400 --> 20:13.850
Also, taking some time to 
recuperate probably helped.

20:13.850 --> 20:16.290
I wonder if it was the open-air baths...

20:16.290 --> 20:18.760
By the way, have you eaten lunch?

20:18.760 --> 20:20.920
Ah! That's right, I haven't yet!

20:20.920 --> 20:22.110
I'm off to go eat!

20:29.790 --> 20:32.790
Happy birthday, Blade!

20:34.260 --> 20:36.360
Today is your birthday.

20:36.360 --> 20:37.710
Huh? It is?

20:38.320 --> 20:40.510
For people who don't know 
when they were born,

20:40.510 --> 20:43.770
they usually celebrate their birthday 
on the day they were fostered.

20:43.770 --> 20:45.220
Huh? What?

20:45.460 --> 20:49.840
You were taken in on this day, 17 years ago!

20:49.840 --> 20:50.930
Master.

20:50.930 --> 20:54.120
Humans should celebrate their 
birth and annihilation.

20:54.120 --> 20:56.080
You're all going to celebrate it?

20:56.080 --> 20:56.850
For me?

20:57.330 --> 20:59.360
Now you're the same age as me.

20:59.360 --> 21:01.070
You were older than me?!

21:01.070 --> 21:02.170
That's right!

21:02.170 --> 21:03.860
So show some respect!

21:05.060 --> 21:09.300
Blade really never had anyone 
celebrate his birthday.

21:09.300 --> 21:10.960
No, I haven't.

21:10.960 --> 21:12.370
Um, what's this?

21:12.600 --> 21:14.630
We were all brainstorming.

21:14.630 --> 21:18.530
To figure out what to get 
you for your birthday.

21:18.530 --> 21:19.880
And Anna suggested this.

21:20.330 --> 21:22.880
I thought you might like it.

21:25.000 --> 21:26.180
Tonkatsu curry!

21:26.180 --> 21:29.490
Let me point out that everything 
is from the Royal Pantry!

21:29.490 --> 21:31.510
Made with the ultimate gourmet ingredients,

21:31.510 --> 21:33.850
it's a one-of-a-kind, special tonkatsu curry!

21:35.260 --> 21:37.740
We got help from His Majesty as well.

21:39.910 --> 21:41.660
Why, it was all quite amusing!

21:41.660 --> 21:44.750
So you all did this for me...

21:45.800 --> 21:48.080
Well? Not going to eat it?

21:48.080 --> 21:51.490
Well, I'm just not used 
to this kind of thing...

21:59.900 --> 22:01.360
What's wrong?

22:01.360 --> 22:03.380
What reason is there to hold back?

22:03.870 --> 22:06.610
Someone told me a long time ago.

22:07.030 --> 22:09.140
That boys should never cry.

22:09.140 --> 22:10.490
You fool!

22:10.490 --> 22:13.510
Manly tears are meant for 
an occasion like this!

22:14.790 --> 22:18.520
In the name of the king, Gilgamesh Soulmaker,

22:18.520 --> 22:22.140
I hereby retract any past statements 
that men shouldn't cry!

22:18.730 --> 22:23.790
<i>The sunny disposition that brings a smile to your face</i>

22:22.140 --> 22:23.520
Go ahead and cry!

22:23.790 --> 22:29.540
<i>As well as the heroic sense of justice</i>

22:29.540 --> 22:34.710
<i>They may be a part of me, but that's not all there is</i>

22:29.640 --> 22:31.820
<i>Thank you, everyone!</i>

22:33.600 --> 22:36.870
<i>This tastes really good!</i>

22:34.710 --> 22:37.410
<i>That image of me</i>

22:37.410 --> 22:40.130
<i>Has taken on a life of its own</i>

22:39.420 --> 22:42.350
<i>Here, for the first time...</i>

22:40.130 --> 22:42.800
<i>Hey, wait up</i>

22:42.800 --> 22:45.220
<i>Won't you be friends with me?</i>

22:43.780 --> 22:46.660
<i>I feel like I've truly 
been born into this world!</i>

22:45.220 --> 22:49.910
<i>Let's shake hands, another self of mine</i>

22:50.570 --> 22:53.330
<i>The wounds we cannot bear alone</i>

22:53.330 --> 22:56.000
<i>The dangers that we keep hidden</i>

22:56.000 --> 22:58.670
<i>We're all hiding them within</i>

22:58.670 --> 23:01.660
<i>Standing ready to strike</i>

23:01.660 --> 23:04.090
<i>The shadow lurking beneath the light</i>

23:04.090 --> 23:08.370
<i>The muffled sounds coming from my lips</i>

23:08.370 --> 23:13.850
<i>They make me feel that I am alive</i>

23:13.850 --> 23:15.690
<i>It's a sign</i>

23:34.510 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.350 --> 23:39.980
<b>The Sophie Series (Part 1)</b>
